32-bit and 64-bit ASan trees (data/bump.grf has no weights; data/bump_imbal_32.grf exercises esmumpsv()),
and `make escheck` at the top level; see $WORK/build.check_esmumps.log, build64.check_esmumps.log,
build.escheck.log, build64.escheck.log.
